<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><documents xmlns:xsi = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation = "HDocumentSchema.xsd"><document type = "H"><pnldref>H17203</pnldref><english><title>Fraudulently cut / tear / remove from material a stamp with intent</title><additionalkeywords><additionalkeyword>stamp</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>fraud</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>fraudulent</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>cutting</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>tore</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>removed</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>intending</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>intend</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>intended</additionalkeyword></additionalkeywords><standardoffencewording>On **(..SPECIFY DATE..) at **(..SPECIFY TOWNSHIP..) fraudulently&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(A)_[cut]_&lt;br /&gt;(B)_[tore]_&lt;br /&gt;(C)_[removed from material]_&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;a stamp, with intent that use should be made of such stamp or of any part thereof</standardoffencewording><legislation>Contrary to to section 13(1), (2) and (4) of the Stamp Duties Management Act 1891.</legislation><pointstoprove>date and location&lt;br /&gt;fraudulently &lt;br /&gt;cut/tore/removed from material a stamp&lt;br /&gt;with intent that some use would be made &lt;br /&gt;of the stamp/part of it</pointstoprove><investigatoractions><investigatoraction><code>IA1</code><description>Fingerprint and photograph</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA2</code><description>DNA Samples: If crime scene stain present - take evidential sample If no crime scene stain and DNA not confirmed on PNC - take Criminal Justice sample. If DNA confirmed on PNC - CJ sample not required</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA27</code><description>Confirm proposed charge is appropriately authorised (Police or CPS)</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA28</code><description>E